CREDITS

Discord status is ported from nfs-most-wanted-mac (MIT, above), which took it from pull request 9 by prex-xo. Thanks to
prex-xo. The update check is ported from the same port's kit/host/update_check.cpp (MIT, above); the idea of an
opt-in update check is SpeedBreaker's, no code taken.

The earlier 3.x versions of this port (this repository's legacy-3.x branch) were built on recomp-kit and
nfsmw-recomp by veritr1x. Version 4.0.0 is a new recompiler and runtime. Apart from the Discord status and the update check
credited above (taken from nfs-most-wanted-mac, MIT), it includes no code from recomp-kit or nfsmw-recomp; thanks to
veritr1x for the earlier work, and to the contributors to the earlier port.

The F10 Gameplay options are in the spirit of the community Extra Options mod (ExOpts Team) but are written from the
game's own code; no code from that mod is included.
